<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch July consumer spending rises 3.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch July consumer spending rises 3.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch consumer spending rose 3.9 percent in volume terms in July compared with the same period of 1995, the Central Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p> DUTCH CONSUMER SPENDING	  July 96   June 96   Jan-July 96</p>
<p>year-on-year pct volume changes</p>
<p> Total consumer spending	   3.9	 1.5	    3.3</p>
<p>  - food, beverages, tobacco     2.5	-1.4	    2.9</p>
<p>  - durable goods		   10.0	 1.4	    4.3</p>
<p>  - other goods and services     2.6	 2.1	    3.1</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
